Joaquin Phoenix has teamed with filmmaker Jonathan Glazer to star in a trippy new campaign for Gentle Monster's AI-powered eyewear collection.

The actor, who famously starred in Spike Jonze's 2013 film Her about a man's relationship with an operating system, wears pieces from the brand's Intelligent Eyewear line as he finds himself in a series of odd scenes. And that is by design, as Gentle Monster details that the campaign skipped a &#8220;straightforward depiction of technology&#8221; in favor of a story that drops viewers &#8220;within a world where the unexpected becomes increasingly ordinary.&#8221; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[620,350],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450],[4,4],[300,251]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Related Stories Movies 'NAZA' Review: A Sober and Indispensable Doc Highlights the Immoral, State-of-the-Art Killing Machine Employed by the IDF in Gaza Movies László Nemes Says an "Orgy of Antisemitism" Is "Overtaking the West"

It finds Phoenix's character, a salesman named Rogers, arriving to a hotel to check-in for two nights. After settling into his room and falling asleep, the man wakes up and lumbers down the hall only to find two costumed characters, one red and one yellow, having a fistfight in a light-drenched room. &#8220;Can you please keep it down? I'm trying to get some sleep,&#8221; he says to the fighters. &#8220;I don't want to be that guy. But really.&#8221; After a knockout, one of the characters approaches Rogers and speaks in an unintelligible language, which he is able to translate using his glasses. After the climactic scene, Rogers checks out early and makes a brisk exit as he's watched intently by multiple hotel staffers. &#8220;The result is a cinematic experience that prioritizes atmosphere, emotion, and imagination over conventional product storytelling,&#8221; reads the Gentle Monster press release.

The 16-piece collection is powered by Google and Samsung and comes in a variety of shapes, colors and lens options ranging in price from $449 to $489. According to Gentle Monster's website, the bulk of pre-orders are already sold-out. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid","mid-article2","mid-articleX"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[300,250],[300,251],[620,350],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450],[4,4]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

In an interview with GQ , Phoenix said he had been wanting to work with Glazer for quite some time. The filmmaker is known for a long list of credits that includes Under the Skin, Birth, Sexy Beast and The Zone of Interest . He's also directed spots for Prada and Apple.

&#8220;I've known him for years, and when we all approached him, we came up with this really interesting and offbeat idea that just [had so] much mood. He just gets super excited and inspired,&#8221; Phoenix told the outlet. But even though viewers may think of his 2013 film in connection to his new AI-fueled campaign, Phoenix told GQ that it wasn't really even on his mind at all. &#8220;It's funny because I think that sometimes films have more of, maybe, an impact on the people that view them than for me, but I hadn't thought about that. Somebody just made a joke about it actually, and I was like, &#8216;Oh yeah, you're right.'&#8221;

As for Glazer, he told GQ that the concept came to life for him with the character at rest: &#8220;The first image I had was him asleep, maybe dreaming, with the glasses all wonky across his face. The rest kind of grew from there.&#8221;

Gentle Monster is shining a light on its Intelligent Eyewear collection at a New York public preview now open at 23 Wall Street through Nov. 23.

BAFTA North America on Tuesday revealed 14 rising film, TV and games creatives as the organization's 2026 BAFTA Breakthrough US cohort, a list thank includes Heated Rivalry star Connor Storrie , Obsession star Inde Navarrette and Backrooms director-composer Kane Parsons .

The program, in its seventh year, is designed to support creatives at pivotal points in their careers, opening access to professional development and industry connections. Recipients undertake a yearlong program that includes one-on-one meetings and career guidance, full BAFTA voting membership, access to BAFTA events and screenings, and networking opportunities worldwide. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article1-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid","mid-articleX","mid-article","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[2,2],[300,250],[620,350],[300,251],[501,282],[3,3],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

This year's list, selected by a jury of industry peers, spans the crafts of costume design, production, casting, editing, games design, performance, directing, composing and cinematography. The names include The &#8216;Burbs creator Celeste Hughey, 1923 costume designer Gaby Acosta, Nuisance Bear director Gabriela Osio Vanden, Night Nurse writer-director Georgia Bernstein and Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 lead writer Jennifer Svedberg-Yen. Watch on Deadline if ( !window.pmc.harmony?.isEventAdScheduledTime() ) { pmcCnx.cmd.push(function() { pmcCnx({ settings: { plugins: { pmcAtlasMG: { iabPlcmt: 2, } } }, playerId: '32fe25c4-79aa-406a-af44-69b41e969e71', playlistId: '0199e506-e642-7728-8264-463efe71337b', }).render("connatix_contextual_player_div"); }); } else { // This should only be get called when page cache is not cleared and it's event time. window.pmc.harmony?.switchToHarmonyPlayer(); }

"The BAFTA Breakthrough US program is an investment in the extraordinary voices shaping what comes next in film, television and games,&#8221; said Courtney LaBarge Bell, executive director of BAFTA North America . &#8220;This year's cohort reflects the imagination, ambition and distinct perspectives that continue to push our industries forward. At a time when emerging creatives face increasing challenges in finding opportunity, mentorship and a path forward, BAFTA is proud to create a space where talent can be recognized, supported and connected to a broader creative community."

Scroll down for the list and bios per BAFTA North America.

Florence Pugh is fully on board for Robert Pattinson &#8216;s James Bond era.

The star appears alongside Pattinson in the upcoming Dune: Part Three , which is also from Bond director Denis Villeneuve . His official casting was announced on Monday morning, and that night Pugh was honored at Elle's Women in Hollywood celebration, where she weighed in on the news.

&#8220;I'm so happy because he's been the no. 1 vote in my household for like quite a long time,&#8221; she told The Hollywood Reporter . &#8220;He's so unbelievably talented. He makes moves that you're just not guessing, and it's just so wonderful to see a career just float and be this unbelievably versatile thing. I'm so excited that he got that role. So good, and with Denis.&#8221; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[620,350],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450],[4,4],[300,251]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Related Stories Movies Robert Pattinson's Bondmaxxing: How 007 Still Has Pop Culture in a Vice Grip Movies We Now Know What Robert Pattinson Was Doing When the James Bond Casting News Broke

Villeneuve also made an appearance at the Los Angeles event to honor Pugh, telling the room at the Four Seasons Beverly Hills that she &#8220;belongs to the stratosphere of major movie stars&#8221; and has &#8220;a rare ability to convey so much inner stillness. She listens with intent and purpose, projecting a deep inner strain, a brilliant intelligence.&#8221;

During her speech, Pugh reflected on her career and paid tribute to the many who have helped her along the way, saying, &#8220;My existence in this job is down to thousands of people.&#8221; She also tossed it back to Villeneuve by revealing, &#8220;I sent Denis a message this morning, and I said, &#8216;Congratulations on finding your Bond. Nice catch. Any villains with the size of a five-foot-four female?'&#8221;

Pattinson's casting &#x2014; up against actors including Callum Turner, Jack Lowden, Josh O'Connor and Nicholas Hoult &#x2014; caps years of speculation in Hollywood for who would take over from Daniel Craig as the next 007. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid","mid-article2","mid-articleX"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[300,250],[300,251],[620,350],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450],[4,4]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

&#8220;James Bond is one of the most legendary characters in cinema, and to be entrusted with 007 is the honor of a lifetime," said Pattinson in a statement. "I'm deeply grateful to Denis, Amy, David, Tanya and everyone at Amazon MGM Studios for their belief in me. To say this role is a dream come true is an understatement. I couldn't be more excited about this partnership and the work ahead with this fantastic team.&#8221;

Apple reported outages across several of its platforms on Tuesday, including iCloud, Apple Pay, the App Store and more.

The company's system status page as of 2:30 p.m. ET showed full or partial outages affecting platforms like the iCloud website, Apple's business services, on-device AppleCare support and more. Users reported outages earlier on Tuesday across services like Apple Pay and the App Store, according to the tracking service Downdetector, though those appear to have resolved. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-variety-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

Apple did not respond to an immediate request for comment.

Performance artist Derek DelGaudio and director Frank Oz are reteaming for &#8220;Unknown Caller,&#8221; a new stage production that debuts next spring at New York City's Public Theater. The two had collaborated on DelGaudio's unconventional one-man show &#8220;In & Of Itself,&#8221; also directed by Oz, which explored themes of identity and illusion.

Veiled in secrecy, &#8220;Unknown Caller&#8221; is described as a &#8220;new encounter with mystery that asks what we can believe in a counterfeit world&#8221; and promises to &#8220;push the boundaries of storytelling and live performance.&#8221; It will world premiere at the Public's LuEster Hall on March 30. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-variety-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Related Stories Disney and the NFL Launch Limited-Edition Mickey & Friends Merch Ahead of Super Bowl LXI Disney Taps Adobe as 'Official AI Innovation Partner' Under Multiyear Pact

"We are becoming more skeptical of what we see and hear," DelGaudio said. "Understandably so, every day we are bombarded by new forgeries and falsehoods. But I have been thinking about what that skepticism costs us. What happens when our first response to something extraordinary is suspicion rather than wonder? That's part of what led me to create &#8216;Unknown Caller.'&#8221;

Oz says working with DelGaudia is like &#8220;jumping off a cliff together into the creative air of uncertainty.&#8221;

"We're grateful to have Oskar [Eustis, artistic director] and the wonderful people at The Public support our odd process in making Unknown Caller,'&#8221; Oz said.

&#8220;In & Of Itself&#8221; ran for more than 500 performances at the Manhattan's Daryl Roth Theatre from 2017 to 2018 before a taped version streamed on Disney+ and Hulu. DelGaudio also created the two-hander &#8220;Nothing to Hide,&#8221; and he appeared in Steven Soderbergh's thriller &#8220;Kimi,&#8221; starring Zoe Kravitz. Oz is best known for directing movies including "In & Out," "Dirty Rotten Scoundrels," and "Death at a Funeral" and voicing iconic characters on "Star Wars," "Muppets" and "Sesame Street." blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid","mid-article2","mid-articleX"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[320,480],[300,250],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

"Derek DelGaudio is a magician of the soul. His performances bring us face to face not with illusions, which are just a vehicle, but with mysteries: the unanswerable questions at the heart of our lives," said the Public's artistic director Oskar Eustis. "Like his director and collaborator Frank Oz, he's transcended any genre and become, simply, one of our most visionary artists."

SAG-AFTRA has tentatively re-upped its solo contract with Netflix .

The guild revealed Tuesday that a tentative agreement had been reached on a new bargaining agreement, which is now subject to approval by the national board.

That vote is expected &#8220;in the near future,&#8221; per the union, and no details from the deal are expected in advance of that review.

The performers' union has had a standalone contract with Netflix Studios since 2019. Before that, the streaming giant dealt with the guild on a production-by-production basis. Guild officials said at the time that, with few exceptions, the contract's terms followed the guild's Codified Basic Agreement and Television Agreements. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article1-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid","mid-articleX","mid-article","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[2,2],[300,250],[620,350],[300,251],[501,282],[3,3],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

